f6nigliche Naturalienkammer zu Dresden</dd>\n<dd>K\u00f6nigliche Naturalienkammer zu Dresden. Description du Cabinet roial de Dresde, touchant l'histoire naturelle</dd></dl></div>","source":"commons-desc-page"},"ImageDescription":{"value":"<div class=\"description\">\n<dl><dd>Binding: paper (sprinkled in black on light orange) over pasteboard, half sheep. Spine gold tooled; paper labels at head and foot with shelfmarks, and leather label tooled with with title: ENTWU / DER / K\u00d6NIG / NATUR / ZU / DRESD</dd>\n<dd>Also published in a German and French ed., and in an ed. with French alone (title: Description du Cabinet roial de Dresde, touchant l'histoire naturelle)</dd>\n<dd>Text by C.H. Eilenburg</dd>\n<dd>The engraved plates are plans of the 1st and 2nd floors of the Zwinger, housing the K\u00f6nigliche Naturalien-Galerien und Curiosit\u00e4ten-Cabineten; legends also in French. Armorial title vignette and headpiece view of the Zwinger by Michael Keyl</dd>\n<dd>Errata: p. [1] at end</dd></dl>\n<br>Subjects: K\u00f6nigliche Naturalienkammer zu Dresden; Zwinger (Museum); Natural history</div>","source":"commons-desc-page"},"LicenseShortName":{"value":"Public domain","source":"commons-desc-page","hidden":""}},"mime":"application/pdf"}]},"199946140":{"pageid":199946140,"ns":6,"title":"File:K\u00f6niglich privilegirte Stettinische Zeitung. 1848, No. 165 (26 August) + dod. (IA jbc.bj.uj.edu pl.0124 NDIGCZAS042923 102909984).pdf","index":9,"imagerepository":"local","imageinfo":[{"size":8930911,"width":1318,"height":2062,"pagecount":6,"thumburl":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/d/d9/K%C3%B6niglich_privilegirte_Stettinische_Zeitung._1848%2C_No._165_%2826_August%29_%2B_dod._%28IA_jbc.bj.uj.edu_pl.0124_NDIGCZAS042923_102909984%29.pdf/page1-960px-K%C3%B6niglich_privilegirte_Stettinische_Zeitung._1848%2C_No._165_%2826_August%29_%2B_dod._%28IA_jbc.bj.uj.edu_pl.0124_NDIGCZAS042923_102909984%29.pdf.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&